lass="r">Engagement</th><th class="r">Engagement per mention</th><th>Client</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Test Author One</b></td><td>Instagram</td><td class="r">6</td><td class="r"><span class="flat">new</span></td><td><span class="mini" role="img" aria-label="3 positive, 2 neutral, 1 negative"><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i><i style="width: 33.333333333333336%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i><i style="width: 16.666666666666668%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i></span></td><td class="r">5.0K</td><td class="r">833</td><td class="r">121</td><td class="r">20.1</td><td><span class="no-print inline-flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="pill" aria-label="Hide Test Author One for this month">Hide</button></span></td></tr><tr><td><b>Test Author Two</b></td><td>Reddit</td><td class="r">4</td><td class="r"><span class="flat">new</span></td><td><span class="mini" role="img" aria-label="1 positive, 1 neutral, 2 negative"><i style="width: 25%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i><i style="width: 25%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i></span></td><td class="r">300</td><td class="r">75</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">2</td><td><span class="no-print inline-flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="pill" aria-label="Hide Test Author Two for this month">Hide</button></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="box"><div data-box="b-authors"></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="secHead"><h2>Most relevant posts</h2><span>Picked by the analyst. Approved posts are shown to the client, at most 12 a month.</span></div><div class="pgroup" data-export-block=""><div class="pgroupHead"><div><h3>Social posts <span>(1)</span></h3><span>The most engaged posts, and a typical negative one</span></div><span class="pnav"><button type="button" class="tbtn">+ Add post</button></span></div><div class="pgrid"><article class="post"><div class="postShots"><div class="shot"><img alt="Screenshot of the Instagram post by Made Up Author" loading="lazy" src="/api/social-listening/image/img-1"></div></div><div class="postBody"><div class="postMeta"><span class="chip">Instagram</span><span class="chip chipPositive">Positive</span><span class="chip">120 engagements</span></div><div class="postWho">Made Up Author</div><p class="postNote">A made-up note.</p><p class="state">Approved, shown to the client</p><div class="postFoot"><a href="https://example.com/post/1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View post ↗</a><span class="spacer"></span><button type="button" class="tbtn">Edit</button></div></div></article></div></div><div class="pgroup" data-export-block=""><div class="pgroupHead"><div><h3>Forum posts <span>(0)</span></h3><span>Reddit can't be exported, so these are screenshots</span></div><span class="pnav"><button type="button" class="tbtn">+ Add post</button></span></div></div><div class="pgroup" data-export-block=""><div class="pgroupHead"><div><h3>Web posts <span>(0)</span></h3><span>Articles and syndicated stories that mention the brand</span></div><span class="pnav"><button type="button" class="tbtn">+ Add post</button></span></div></div><div data-box="b-posts"></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><div data-export-block=""><div data-box="b-takeaways"></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Keyword appendix</h2><div data-export-block=""><div data-box="b-keywords"></div></div></section><p class="source">Source: Talkwalker export of the topic "Made Up Brand", October 1 to 31, 2026 (Eastern). Changes compare with the September report as presented to the client.</p></div></div>"`;

